                                "sense_id": "99dfe83d-ab5e-311a-b7f1-d4446ef07dc7",
                                "text": "I take out my pocket knife and start to smooth it. What do you want with that stick says Jan. Nothing. Well throw it away. No jong I am going to keep it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
